{"seq":2,"slug":"compaction-strategy-scheduling","title":"Compaction 策略选择、打分调度与并行度控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/sst-format-compaction/compaction-strategy-scheduling","wordCount":2571,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"compaction-策略选择-打分调度与并行度控制\">Compaction 策略选择、打分调度与并行度控制</h1><p>上一节拆开了单个 SST 的字节布局（见 <a href=\"sst-file-format-and-index\">SST 文件格式、块编码与分区索引/过滤器</a>），但文件何时被创建、何时被合并、合并谁，由另一套机制决定。这一篇讲的是 LSM 树的<strong>调度面</strong>：三类 compaction 策略各自适配什么负载，后台线程怎样用打分函数挑出下一个任务，以及并行度、限流与 stall 阈值如何把合并的 IO 压力约束在可接受的范围内。对一个把 RocksDB 当嵌入式引擎塞进订单/库存服务的团队来说，改错一个 <code>max_bytes_for_level_multiplier</code> 通常不会立刻报错，而是在流量峰值时以写停顿的形式浮现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类策略-打分与并行度的分层\">核心概念：三类策略、打分与并行度的分层</h2><p>调度面可以拆成三层，每层回答一个独立的问题：<strong>策略</strong>（<code>compaction_style</code>）决定合并的拓扑形状，是读放大、写放大、空间放大三角取舍的骨架；<strong>打分与 picker</strong> 决定每一轮「先合并谁」，是随负载动态变化的部分；<strong>并行度与限流</strong>决定合并以多快的速度、占用多少 IO 执行。三者是层层收窄的关系——策略定错，后两层调参只能缓解症状；策略定对，后两层才决定峰值表现。下面按这个顺序展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类策略-leveled-universal-fifo\">三类策略：Leveled、Universal、FIFO</h2><p>RocksDB 不是只有一种 compaction。<code>Options::compaction_style</code> 有三个长期在用的取值，各自对应一类清晰的负载形状，选错方向后调参只能缓解、无法逆转。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>读放大</th>\n<th>写放大</th>\n<th>空间放大</th>\n<th>典型适配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>kCompactionStyleLevel</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>分层，层间容量按倍率增长</td>\n<td>低（每层最多一次查）</td>\n<td>高（数据被反复下推）</td>\n<td>低（≈1.1）</td>\n<td>读多写少、范围扫描、事务型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kCompactionStyleUniversal</code></td>\n<td>少量有序 run 顺序合并</td>\n<td>高（需查多个 run）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>可高可低</td>\n<td>写密集、时序追加、可接受读放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kCompactionStyleFIFO</code></td>\n<td>只按时间淘汰最旧文件</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低（几乎不重写）</td>\n<td>由容量上限决定</td>\n<td>缓存/会话/TTL 数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Leveled 是默认值，也是唯一能给出稳定读延迟的策略：任意一层内 key 区间不重叠，一次点查最多每层碰一个文件，读放大被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 SST 量级。代价是写放大——一条新写入的记录会被逐层下推，每下一层都要与目标层重叠区间重写一次。</p>\n<p>常见近似：设层间容量倍率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、有效层数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WA \\approx \\frac{T}{T-1}\\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=10, L=7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 7.8 倍。这就是为什么「RocksDB 写吞吐上不去」的第一诊断项往往是写放大而非磁盘带宽。值得对照的是 <a href=\"../lsm-architecture-write-read/lsm-tree-structure-write-path\">LSM 树结构与写路径</a> 里 memtable → L0 的写入链路：写放大只在 L0 之下的合并阶段产生，memtable 与 WAL 的写入量本身是 1 倍。</p>\n<p>Universal compaction 反过来：它保留多个有序 run，新数据以小 run 形式并入，只在 run 数量或大小超过阈值时才做一次大合并，因此写放大接近 1，但一次点查可能要查遍所有 run。若业务是「按时间写、按 key 点查、几乎不范围扫描」（例如订单状态流水、设备上报），Universal + 布隆过滤器是合理组合。FIFO 则完全不做合并，只在 <code>max_table_files_size</code> 触顶或超过 <code>ttl</code>/<code>periodic_compaction_seconds</code> 时从最旧文件开始删——适合可以丢数据的缓存层，绝不适合当作主存储，因为 FIFO 下重复 key 只会在淘汰时消失，读放大随时间线性增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打分函数与-picker-谁先被调度\">打分函数与 picker：谁先被调度</h2><p>后台 compaction 不是轮询，而是「打分 + 取最高分」。<code>db/version_set.cc</code> 的 picker 对每一层计算归一化得分，挑最大者执行；得分同时是触发档位的判据。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">level0_file_num_compaction_trigger</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{L0} = \\frac{N_{files}(L0)}{\\texttt{level0\\_file\\_num\\_compaction\\_trigger}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3352em;vertical-align:-0.9082em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">level0_file_num_compaction_trigger</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9082em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{Ln} = \\frac{bytes(Ln)}{max\\_bytes\\_for\\_level(n)}\\quad(n\\ge 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.423em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">max_bytes_for_level_base</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">max\\_bytes\\_for\\_level(n) = \\texttt{max\\_bytes\\_for\\_level\\_base}\\times multiplier^{\\,n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">max_bytes_for_level_base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>默认 <code>level0_file_num_compaction_trigger = 4</code>、<code>max_bytes_for_level_base = 256MB</code>、<code>max_bytes_for_level_multiplier = 10</code>（RocksDB Tuning Guide / <code>include/rocksdb/options.h</code> 默认值）。也就是说 L0 攒到 4 个文件、或任意层超出其容量预算，该层得分过 1，picker 排队。得分最高的层先被处理，这解释了为什么一次突发写入常表现为 L0 文件数飙升后一次性触发多层连锁合并。</p>\n<p>选层之后还要<strong>选文件</strong>，由 <code>CompactionPri</code> 决定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>kMinOverlappingRatio</code>（默认）：优先选与下一层重叠字节最少的文件，直接压低写放大，是 RocksDB 5.x 之后取代 <code>kByCompensatedSize</code> 的关键改动。</li>\n<li><code>kOldestSmallestSeqFirst</code> / <code>kOldestLargestSeqFirst</code>：按 seqno 新旧选，适合想让过期数据尽快被回收、或想尽快固化最新写入的场景。</li>\n<li><code>kByCompensatedSize</code>：按文件大小加权选，对写入均匀、无明显倾斜的负载仍可用。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[后台 compaction 线程唤醒] --&gt; B[遍历各层计算 score]&#10;  B --&gt; C{最高 score 所在层}&#10;  C --&gt;|L0| D[按 seqno/文件数选 L0 输入集]&#10;  C --&gt;|Ln| E[按 CompactionPri 选文件&lt;br/&gt;默认 min-overlapping-ratio]&#10;  D --&gt; F[与下层重叠区间确定输入范围]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[划分 subcompaction 区间]&#10;  G --&gt; H[多线程执行并写出新 SST]&#10;  H --&gt; I[原子 InstallCompactionResults&lt;br/&gt;version edit 切换]&#10;  I --&gt; J[删除被替换的旧文件]\">graph TD\n  A[后台 compaction 线程唤醒] --&gt; B[遍历各层计算 score]\n  B --&gt; C{最高 score 所在层}\n  C --&gt;|L0| D[按 seqno/文件数选 L0 输入集]\n  C --&gt;|Ln| E[按 CompactionPri 选文件&lt;br/&gt;默认 min-overlapping-ratio]\n  D --&gt; F[与下层重叠区间确定输入范围]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[划分 subcompaction 区间]\n  G --&gt; H[多线程执行并写出新 SST]\n  H --&gt; I[原子 InstallCompactionResults&lt;br/&gt;version edit 切换]\n  I --&gt; J[删除被替换的旧文件]</pre><p>一个容易踩的坑：<code>level_compaction_dynamic_level_bytes = true</code>（RocksDB 6.x 起推荐开启）会让底层容量按实际数据量动态推算，未达到数据量的层可以是空的，从而显著降低空间放大。但它要求从一个空 DB 或一次全量重建开始，在中途打开会导致已有文件布局与新的容量模型不匹配——切换前必须 <code>CompactRange</code> 一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行度与线程模型\">并行度与线程模型</h2><p>从 RocksDB 5.7 起，后台任务统一到 <code>max_background_jobs</code> 一个旋钮（替代已废弃的 <code>max_background_compactions</code> / <code>max_background_flushes</code>），内部再拆分为 flush 线程与 compaction 线程。经验起点是把它设为 CPU 核数，IO 密集的云盘环境可更高，但线程数不是瓶颈的解药——若 <code>max_subcompactions = 1</code>，单个 compaction 任务仍只用一个线程。</p>\n<p><code>max_subcompactions &gt; 1</code> 是真正的单任务并行：picker 把一次 compaction 的输出 key 区间切成若干段，每段由一个线程独立读入、合并、写出，最后拼接结果。它能把一次大合并的墙钟时间缩短数倍，但要求区间切分均匀，否则最慢的那段决定整体时长。对 SSD/NVMe 与多核环境，<code>max_subcompactions = min(核数, 4~8)</code> 是常见配置；对单块机械盘或限速云盘，加大它只会让 IO 争抢更严重。</p>\n<p>文件粒度也要与并行度匹配：<code>target_file_size_base</code> 默认 64MB，配合倍率 <code>target_file_size_multiplier</code>（默认 1，即各层同尺寸）。若目标文件太小，一个 L1 层的 compaction 会产出成百上千个小文件，元数据与后续 picker 的选取开销都会上升；太大则单次合并的尾延迟变长、subcompaction 切分空间变小。</p>\n<p><code>compaction_readahead_size</code> 与 <code>rate_limiter</code> 控制的是<strong>外部影响</strong>：前者让 compaction 连续读时预读更多（对机械盘收益明显，对 NVMe 通常设为 0 避免读放大），后者把 compaction 的写带宽限流，防止后台合并把前台查询的 IO 挤干。生产上更实际的做法是给 compaction 设一个共享的 <code>RateLimiter</code> 并留足前台余量，而不是靠 stall 被动刹车。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发边界-限流与生产观测\">触发边界、限流与生产观测</h2><p>即使策略与并行度都对，也需要一组「刹车」——当写入速度长期超过 compaction 消化能力时，RocksDB 必须先减速再停止写入，否则 L0 文件无限堆积、读放大爆炸。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>level0_slowdown_writes_trigger</code></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>L0 文件数达到即开始主动 sleep 写入线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>level0_stop_writes_trigger</code></td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>L0 文件数达到即完全停写，直到 compaction 追上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>soft_pending_compaction_bytes_limit</code></td>\n<td>64GB</td>\n<td>待 compaction 字节数超限即 slowdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hard_pending_compaction_bytes_limit</code></td>\n<td>256GB</td>\n<td>超限即停写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_background_jobs</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>后台线程总数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（默认值见 RocksDB Tuning Guide 与 <code>include/rocksdb/options.h</code>。）</p>\n<p>停写是最贵的事件：对跨境电商的订单写入服务，一次 stop-writes 意味着下单接口直接阻塞到 compaction 追平，可能长达数十秒。因此监控的重点从来不是「有没有 compaction」，而是三个先行指标：<strong>L0 文件数 / <code>level0_slowdown_writes_trigger</code> 的比值</strong>、<code>rocksdb.compaction-pending</code> 是否长期为 1、以及 <code>rocksdb.estimate-pending-compaction-bytes</code> 的增速。三者中任一持续走高，都说明当前 <code>max_background_jobs</code> 与 <code>max_bytes_for_level_*</code> 的组合与写入速率不匹配。</p>\n<p><code>Statistics</code> 里还有一条被低估的计数器：<code>rocksdb.compaction.key.drop.obsolete</code> 与 <code>rocksdb.compaction.key.drop.range_del</code>。它们直接反映合并中真正被丢弃的过期数据量——若业务大量使用 TTL 或范围删除，这两个值长期接近写入量，说明 compaction 正在做有效回收；若长期为 0，则可能是 <code>kMinOverlappingRatio</code> 一直挑选重叠小的文件、把过期数据留在了下层，需要配合 <code>periodic_compaction_seconds</code> 强制回收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"具体取舍-把策略映射到负载\">具体取舍：把策略映射到负载</h2><p>回到嵌入式工程的决策顺序。一个合理的判断链是：先问「数据能不能丢」——能丢就用 FIFO；再问「读还是写主导」——写主导且可接受读放大就用 Universal；其余默认走 Leveled 并调参。对绝大多数用 RocksDB 承载业务状态的团队，Leveled 是正确答案，工作集中在三组参数上：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>容量与倍率</strong>：<code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code> 与 <code>max_bytes_for_level_multiplier</code> 决定层数与写放大，倍率从 10 降到 8 会减少层数、降低 WA，但抬高每层容量与单次合并体积；配合 <code>level_compaction_dynamic_level_bytes = true</code> 通常比手调倍率更省心。</li>\n<li><strong>并行度</strong>：<code>max_background_jobs ≈ 核数</code>、<code>max_subcompactions</code> 视盘而定（NVMe 4~8，机械盘 1），并用 <code>rate_limiter</code> 给后台合并封顶。</li>\n<li><strong>刹车与回收</strong>：stall 阈值按 SLA 反推——若不能容忍超过 1s 的写入阻塞，就把 <code>level0_slowdown_writes_trigger</code> 调低、给 compaction 更多余量，而不是把 stop 阈值调高。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>策略一旦在已有 DB 上切换（例如 Leveled → Universal），RocksDB 不会自动重排已有文件，需要一次 <code>CompactRange</code> 或全量重建，这也是为什么策略选择应当在上线前定稿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>策略是骨架：Leveled 用写放大换稳定的读延迟与低空间放大，Universal 用读放大换低写放大，FIFO 只适合可丢数据的缓存层，且在已有 DB 上切换必须配合一次全量重排。</li>\n<li>打分是动态选择：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{L0}=N_{files}/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{Ln}=bytes(Ln)/max\\_bytes\\_for\\_level(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，拾最高分执行；默认 <code>CompactionPri = kMinOverlappingRatio</code> 通过挑重叠最小的文件来压写放大。</li>\n<li>并行度要分两件事：<code>max_background_jobs</code> 决定后台任务数，<code>max_subcompactions</code> 才决定单次合并用几个线程；文件大小 <code>target_file_size_base</code> 需与之匹配。</li>\n<li>刹车靠阈值与限流：<code>level0_slowdown_writes_trigger=20</code>、<code>level0_stop_writes_trigger=36</code> 是默认档次，生产上应据 SLA 反向推导并优先用 <code>RateLimiter</code> 而非被动 stall。</li>\n<li>观测看先行指标：L0 文件数占阈值比例、<code>rocksdb.compaction-pending</code>、<code>rocksdb.estimate-pending-compaction-bytes</code> 增速，比事后统计更能提前发现 compaction 追不上写入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇转向这套机制在压力下暴露的症状：写停顿、memtable 内存占用与 compaction 的相互作用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compaction 策略选择、打分调度与并行度控制","id":"compaction-策略选择-打分调度与并行度控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类策略、打分与并行度的分层","id":"核心概念-三类策略-打分与并行度的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"三类策略：Leveled、Universal、FIFO","id":"三类策略-leveled-universal-fifo"},{"level":2,"text":"打分函数与 picker：谁先被调度","id":"打分函数与-picker-谁先被调度"},{"level":2,"text":"并行度与线程模型","id":"并行度与线程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"触发边界、限流与生产观测","id":"触发边界-限流与生产观测"},{"level":2,"text":"具体取舍：把策略映射到负载","id":"具体取舍-把策略映射到负载"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SST 文件格式、块编码与分区索引/过滤器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/sst-format-compaction/sst-file-format-and-index"},"next":{"title":"墓碑/范围删除回收、compaction filter 与 BlobDB 空间治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/sst-format-compaction/tombstone-space-and-blob-management"}}